  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 704.04 Public Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 704.04 Public Hearing. A public, non-adjudicative hearing shall be held by the department in accordance with the provisions of Env-C 200 prior to approving an application for any project in a prime wetlands/buffer if required by Env-Wt 704.03(d) or RSA 482-A:8, unless the project is exempt pursuant to RSA 482-A:11, IV(d).\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 700) #12807, eff 12-15-19; ss by #13946, eff 4-27-24",
